# The volume screen from the main menu, one Down onto the music's slider
# and held there: while a slider is selected the screen plays sample 126,
# or 34, every 30 ticks at a random balance from full left to the centre,
# for dosrun -r to record and tools/loudness.py -c to read channel by
# channel. A menu that returns on Return leaves the next to read the same
# key while it is down, so keys are short here. Areas are of the 1280x960
# screen dosrun's DOSBox draws in.

hold 0.05
wait menu 814x76+234+470 150
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot volume
key Down
sleep 30
shot slider
key Up Return
sleep 3
